| Change | File | Effort |
|--------|------|--------|
| Add `"fear"` sentiment | `engine.py` L140, system prompt | 5 min |
| Dialect examples in prompt | `engine.py` system prompt | 10 min |
| Civic taxonomy in prompt | `engine.py` system prompt | 10 min |
| `partially_correct` intent | `engine.py` + `app.py` | 20 min |
| Sarvam TTS swap | `engine.py` generate_tts() | 25 min |
