---

## Recommended Priority Order

```
1. Add "fear" sentiment + dialect/taxonomy prompt  (15 min) — Quick compliance wins
2. Sarvam TTS for native voice playback           (25 min) — Core differentiator
3. Sarvam translate for verification prompt        (20 min) — Voice-to-voice completeness
4. "Partially correct" intent flow                 (20 min) — Judging criteria match
5. Dual transcript display                         (25 min) — Human-in-the-loop showcase
6. Retry with context preservation                 (20 min) — Learning from feedback
```

> [!TIP]
> Items 1-4 alone would cover **all 7 requirements** in the problem statement and can be done in ~80 minutes.
